":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/comments/40409814","html_url":"https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3039#issuecomment-40409814","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3039","id":40409814,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQwNDA5ODE0","user":{"login":"ssaeger","id":1192254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTIyNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1192254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger","html_url":"https://github.com/ssaeger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-04-14T19:49:27Z","updated_at":"2014-04-14T19:49:27Z","body":"I figured out that the error arises from this line:\n\n```\nn_reassigns = min(to_reassign.sum(), X.shape[0])\n```\n\nIf the number of clusters that should be reassigned is bigger than `X.shape[0]` then `n_reassigns` gets the value of `X.shape[0]` and the following assignment fails:\n\n```\ncenters[to_reassign] = X[new_centers]\n```\n\nThis assignment fails because the length of `new_centers` is different than the sum of `True` values in `to_reassign`.\n\nThis computation of `n_reassigns` was changed in [`e3583da`](https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/commit/e3583daa2f196b5822f784c7e53f081668ecef6d) and I would suggest to change this computation back into:\n\n```\nn_reassigns = to_reassign.sum()\n```\n\nBut I'm not completely sure about the reason for this change in [`e3583da`](https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/commit/e3583daa2f196b5822f784c7e53f081668ecef6d), so maybe there is a better way to fix this bug.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/comments/40409814/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ssaeger","id":1192254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTIyNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1192254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger","html_url":"https://github.com/ssaeger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"ssaeger","id":1192254,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTIyNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1192254?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger","html_url":"https://github.com/ssaeger","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ssaeger/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users